{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Famous Artists", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Musical Geniuses ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Genres of Music", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are many genres of music. People often talk about what <span class=\"strong\">kind </span> of music they like. They are talking about what genre of music they enjoy listening to.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I like to listen to rock. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Here is a list of some music genres:  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Rock <br>Pop<br> Country<br> Classical <br>Electronic<br> Folk<br> Contemporary<br> Metal<br> Rap/Hip-hop ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " What is your favorite kind of music?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I love classical music.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Present Perfect Tense vs. The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "While we use the Simple Past and the Present Perfect to talk  about past events, there are significant differences in their usage. Observe the examples:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">loved</span> Michael Jackson when I was a child.</span> (A past event at a specific time.) <br/><span class=\"italic\">I<span class=\"strong\">'ve</span> always <span class=\"strong\">loved</span> pop music. </span>(The event started some time in the past and continues today.) <br/><span class=\"italic\">He<span class=\"strong\">'s attended</span> many classical music performances.</span>  (The action happened in the past, but we don't know the specific time.) <br/><span class=\"italic\">Michael Jackson's music <span class=\"strong\">has influenced</span> many generations.  </span><br/>(There is a present connection with a past event.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In speaking, you can shorten the auxiliary verb of the Present Perfect by  using the contractions <span class=\"italic\">'ve</span></span> and <span class=\"italic\">'s</span>.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">I've always loved rock music. <br/> Stevie Wonder's been my favorite artist since I was at school.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " The following chart shows the contraction of the auxiliary verb  <span class=\"italic\">to have</span> for the Present Perfect:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect Auxiliary\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Contraction\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Contraction in the Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I've\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I haven't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You've\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You haven't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He/She/It\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He's/She's/It's\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He/She/It hasn't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We've\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We haven't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They've\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They haven't\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Examples</span>:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Beethoven<span class=\"strong\">'s been</span> an influential musician for centuries.<br/> She <span class=\"strong\">hasn't heard</span> classical music.<br/> We<span class=\"strong\">'ve followed</span> Bob Dylan's music since we were young kids.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "timeless ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "relevant and important across time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Mozart's music is timeless.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about musical geniuses.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "moving ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "causing someone to feel strong emotions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Mozart wrote moving music.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "prolific ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "highly productive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Mozart and Beethoven were both prolific composers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "genre ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "type; sort ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My favorite genre of music is rock.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "relevant ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "connected to the current time ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Bob Dylan's lyrics have remained relevant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "groundbreaking ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "unusual; innovative ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Stevie Wonder wrote groundbreaking songs.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "concept", "type": "name"}, {"content": " idea; notion ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Michael Jackson's ground-breaking concepts have had an impact on modern day musicians.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write down 5 adjectives to describe your favorite musician or their work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Show your list to your partner. Tell them to ask you a question using each adjective. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain why you chose those 5 words.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write 5 adjectives about my favorite singer or musician.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain why I chose those words to my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask my partner questions about their list of adjectives.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le06ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le06ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Has anyone ever asked you who your favorite musician is? It's such a hard question to answer! I like to think about musical geniuses of the past and today! Have you ever heard of Mozart or Beethoven? They were classical music composers  - both prolific and extremely influential. Their ability to magically write music that is timeless and moving has not been seen or heard of since their time."}, {"image": "engenn6le06ob07re2img03.jpg", "time": "28000", "id": 2, "text": "I've always loved rock music. Within that genre of music, there are many musical geniuses. John Lennon, a member of The Beatles, Bob Dylan and Freddie Mercury (from Queen) are seen as pioneers of their generation and beyond. They boldly challenged people's ideas of what music was. They expertly composed lyrics that have remained relevant until now."}, {"image": "engenn6le06ob07re2img04.jpg", "time": "54000", "id": 3, "text": "Michael Jackson and Stevie Wonder are musical geniuses of the pop music industry. Their groundbreaking sounds and concepts have had an impact on the way that many modern-day musicians sing and perform."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le06ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le06ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "engenn6le06ob07re6aud08", "type": "audio"}], "id": 2}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "Has anyone ever asked you who your favorite musician is? It's such a hard question to answer! I like to think about musical geniuses of the past and today! Have you ever heard of Mozart or Beethoven? They were classical music composers - both prolific and extremely influential. Their ability to magically write music that is timeless and moving has not been seen\n or heard of since their time.<br/><br/>\nI've always loved rock music. Within that genre of music, there are many musical geniuses. John Lennon, a member of The Beatles, Bob Dylan and Freddie Mercury (from Queen) are seen as pioneers of their generation and beyond. They boldly challenged people's ideas of what music was. They expertly composed lyrics that have remained relevant until now.<br/><br/>\nMichael Jackson and Stevie Wonder are musical geniuses of the pop music industry. Their groundbreaking sounds and concepts have had an impact on the way that many modern-day musicians sing and perform.", "type": "p"}], "id": 3}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can describe people I admire.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can describe experiences I've had or haven't had.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can talk about how something happens or how someone behaves. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Who is your favorite singer? Why? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Have you ever written a song?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's discover musical geniuses of the past and today!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_overri